rding to git status, `.story-updates/STORY-setup-001a.passed` is deleted (D). It needs to be recreated.\n\nPer the contract, I need to read the agent file before spawning. Let me read the ecc-code-reviewer.md file and spawn the reviewer with its full contents + task.\n\nAlso, I should first quickly verify the state (git status, whether tests pass) — but that's a read-only check, so it's fine for the orchestrator to do. Actually, the contract says to delegate all tasks, but read-only status checks for coordination purposes are part of coordination. Keep it minimal.\n\nFirst let me read the code-reviewer agent file.\n\nPlan:\n1. Read .claude/agents/ecc-code-reviewer.md\n2. Spawn code-reviewer (no model, no subagent_type — default general-purpose… actually per the contract \"do not set subagent_type\" — in the previous attempt the default general-purpose was used and it worked).\n3. Block on TaskOutput until completion.\n4. If PASS: touch the marker, ls, git add/commit, push.\n\nLet's get started.\n","signature":"17b7ac5d53d54fe39bc1064f8c814588"}],"model":"unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":76013,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"681c89b4-fb9f-4fac-9e19-2a78fa4e57c8","uuid":"3ddc48b6-4d48-4e95-aea2-cea18d194df0","timestamp":"2026-08-20T14:50:47.143Z"}
