— CRITICAL or HIGH issues (list them)\n\nDo not modify any files. Read-only review only (you may run read-only shell commands such as git show, git log, node --test).","result":"\n\nReview complete. Working tree matches HEAD for all story files (empty diff), and the story files are verified against the acceptance criteria.\n\n**Acceptance criteria verification:**\n\n| # | Criterion | Result |\n|---|-----------|--------|\n| 1 | Root `package.json` with `name: \"nextmove\"`, `private: true`, `workspaces: [\"apps/*\"]`, `packageManager: \"npm@10\"`, `engines.node: \"22.x\"` | PASS — all present at `package.json:2-6`; asserted by tests \"AC 1\" and \"AC 2\" |\n| 2 | `devDependencies` pin turbo 2.x; `build`/`test`/`lint` scripts are `turbo run build|test|lint` | PASS — `turbo: ^2.5.0` (resolves to 2.10.11 in the lockfile) at `package.json:7`; scripts at `package.json:9-11`; asserted by test \"AC 3\" |\n| 3 | Scaffold files committed to the existing git repo, git commands exit 0 | PASS — commit `6cc5d66` contains all four files; `git show`, `git diff`, and `node --test` all exited 0 |\n\n**Test run:** `node --test test/package.test.cjs` → 4/4 pass, 0 fail, exit 0.\n\n**Checklist review of the story files:**\n- `/home/nitin-sharma/ralph-workspaces/6896163a-932b-4b96-bfe9-cdbb022c3538/c7df6267-784a-460a-addd-6d781a21b6f5/package.json` — 13 lines, no secrets, no scripts with shell interpolation, no network calls. Clean.\n- `/home/nitin-sharma/ralph-workspaces/6896163a-932b-4b96-bfe9-cdbb022c3538/c7df6267-784a-460a-addd-6d781a21b6f5/test/package.test.cjs` — uses `node:test` + `assert/strict`, strict mode, maps 1:1 to the acceptance criteria, no debug logging, no dead code. (Re-reading package.json per test is idiomatic for config tests — not a finding.)\n- `/home/nitin-sharma/ralph-workspaces/6896163a-932b-4b96-bfe9-cdbb022c3538/c7df6267-784a-460a-addd-6d781a21b6f5/package-lock.json` — lockfileVersion 3, name `nextmove`, all 7 resolved entries point at the public `registry.np